// Drift guard between the web wire types and the API's OpenAPI components
// (snapshot in openapi.schemas.json, regenerated by apps/api/scripts/export_openapi.py).
//
// A field map is typed `Record<keyof T, true>`, so TypeScript rejects a map
// that misses or adds a field of the web type; the runtime check then compares
// those keys with the API's property names.
